                    <div class="settings-preferences">
                        <div class="settings-preference"><span><strong>Local storage</strong><small>Conversations, preferences, and workspace metadata remain on this installation.</small></span><strong class="capability-ready">Local</strong></div>
                        <div class="settings-preference"><span><strong>Export and deletion</strong><small>Use the workspace and chat actions to export or delete individual records.</small></span><button type="button" class="capability-action-button" data-settings-action="data">Review</button></div>
